' sequence: CommandArrow, CommandLinkAnchor, CommandGrouping, CommandBoxStart
@startuml
!pragma teoz true
box "Teoz box" #LightBlue
participant Alice
participant Bob
end box
{start} Alice -> Bob : start doing things
& Bob -> Carl : at the same time
Bob -> Alice : finish {end}
{start} <-> {end} : some time
Alice -> Bob : multicast & Carl
Alice -> Bob & Carl : multicast
alt teoz group
  Alice -> Bob
end
Alice -> Bob !! : destroy
@enduml
